<http://data.silknow.org/object/fc63f5ee-24bc-31d5-a0a8-febdf631a1cb/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Blue shirt with big flower design.  Red trim at neckline.  Crossover construction with a matching red tie on left side.  \n\nGray-brown tweed cropped jacket with tie closures in front.  Round neckline, long sleeves. Blackwhipstitch thread around neckline and cuffs.  Blue floral lining (same as shirt).  \n\nGray-brown tweed skirt.  Blue, black and multi-colored patches (all with floral patterns) create a geometric design on the skirt."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/fc63f5ee-24bc-31d5-a0a8-febdf631a1cb> .

